Subject: [PATCH 097/190] misc: xilinx-ai-engine: Initializes the return value

commit 84cf5474c8adbcdb9241482c57c7bc178038fc4a from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Initialized the return value to avoid the if statement checking
the uninitialized garbage return value in aie2ps_set_part_clocks.

Signed-off-by: Keerthanna Mohan <keerthanna.mohan@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250911230525.1137841-1-keerthanna.mohan@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c b/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c
index 57b23cf327de..1209a8db69b5 100644
